      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout le monde sait que la compétition entre\nles cafés à Illumis est féroce...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour créer un nouveau menu et me démarquer de\nla concurrence, j’ai besoin de l’aide de Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense particulièrement à un Feuillajou,\nun Flamajou et un Flotajou !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ils ont beau se ressembler, leurs caractéristiques\nse distinguent de manière flagrante.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les feuilles qui poussent sur la tête d’un\nFeuillajou soignent la fatigue !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le brasier de la mèche d’un Flamajou\npeut atteindre 300 °C !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000620072006100730069006500720020006400650020006C00610020006D00E80063006800650020006420190075006E00200046006C0061006D0061006A006F0075000A0070006500750074002000610074007400650069006E0064007200650020003300300030002000B000430020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quant à Flotajou, la houppette sur sa tête\nest gorgée d’une eau riche en nutriments !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurai avec moi des feuilles énergisantes,\nune eau nutritive, et le feu pour la faire bouillir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En combinant les spécialités de ces trois\ncompères, je vais faire le meilleur thé du monde !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu captures ces trois Pokémon, pourrais-tu faire\nen sorte qu’ils m’aident ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand j’aurai obtenu le thé parfait, je te\nle ferai goûter !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E00640020006A2019006100750072006100690020006F006200740065006E00750020006C006500200074006800E900200070006100720066006100690074002C0020006A0065002000740065000A006C006500200066006500720061006900200067006F00FB0074006500720020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurais besoin que tu mettes un Feuillajou,\nun Flamajou et un Flotajou dans ton équipe,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net que tu leur demandes de m’aider !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Voilà un Feuillajou, un Flamajou et\nun Flotajou !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020002100200056006F0069006C00E000200075006E00200046006500750069006C006C0061006A006F0075002C00200075006E00200046006C0061006D0061006A006F0075002000650074000A0075006E00200046006C006F00740061006A006F00750020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci ! Si tu veux bien patienter un instant,\nje n’en ai pas pour longtemps.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0069006C00E00020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici le Thé Outanjaya, combinant les spécialités\nde Feuillajou, de Flamajou et de Flotajou !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe voulais l’appeler « Thé Feuillaflamaflotajou »,\nmais c’était long et pas très vendeur...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 193
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour te remercier de ton aide, à toi l’honneur !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00750072002000740065002000720065006D00650072006300690065007200200064006500200074006F006E00200061006900640065002C002000E000200074006F00690020006C20190068006F006E006E0065007500720020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu en dis ? C’est léger, c’est bon,\nc’est parfumé... c’est parfait, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! J’allais oublier de te rendre tes Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002000210020004A20190061006C006C0061006900730020006F00750062006C006900650072002000640065002000740065002000720065006E006400720065002000740065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce à l’aide de tes trois Pokémon, j’ai pu ajouter\nle Thé Outanjaya à mon menu régulier !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
